### getall books 
GET http://localhost:3000/books/

### get one book by id

GET http://localhost:3000/books/4/

### Add a book 
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Python Basics",
  "author": "John",
  "price": 350,
  "pages": 250
}

### Update a book by ID

PUT http://localhost:3000/books/6/
Content-Type: application/json

{
"title": "Python Programming",
"author": "John",
"price": 450,
"pages": 300
}



### Delete a book by ID

DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/9/